“Husband on dialysis; waiting list for kidney since early 2023. Started novena March 2025. In May he was placed on new transplant program list about 4 hours from home. Initially I prayed he would receive kidney in town as didn’t want to travel & be apart from loved ones. In May, I felt a calling to not be selfish & just pray for kidney as husband getting sicker. End of June, 2025, got call they had a kidney for him. He almost died during transplant surgery (coded). I prayed I could get a priest to hospital being out of town & such (not our home parish), to administer last rites before he went back for a second surgery same day (internal bleeding). Surgeon had already said he would do his best to locate bleeding, but basically prepared for the worst. I happened upon a priest on the eleva…”
